    <bpmn:process id="W_W570" name="W570. Loyalty Points Expiry Management &amp; Annual Liability Cleanup" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual points expiry cycle (configurable, default: points expire 24 months from earn date if no qualifying transaction); quarterly deferred revenue liability review
Frequency: Annual batch expiry processing (configurable timing, typically January after holiday peak); quarterly liability review
Volume: ~50,000–100,000 member accounts with expiring points per cycle; estimated expiring-cohort deferred revenue of ~PHP 150–250M per cycle (the expiring subset of the PHP 150–600M cumulative liability canon per W104/W1316; based on 600,000 members × average outstanding points)
Owner: Loyalty Program Manager / Finance Manager
Participants: Loyalty Program Manager, Finance Manager (A for financial reporting), CRM Analyst (R for data processing), Digital Marketing Specialist (C for notifications), Customer Service Lead (I for inbound inquiries)
Source: workflow W570 — Loyalty Points Expiry Management &amp; Annual Liability Cleanup</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W570_LaneSet7">
        <bpmn:lane id="W570_Lane1" name="Finance Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W570_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W570_Task19</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W570_Start8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W570_Lane2" name="Loyalty Program Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W570_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W570_Task20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W570_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W570_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W570_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W570_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W570_Task16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W570_Task17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W570_Lane4" name="Digital Marketing Specialist">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W570_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W570_Lane5" name="Customer Service Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W570_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W570_Lane6" name="CRM Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W570_Task18</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W570_End21</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W570_Start8" name="Annual points expiry cycle (configurable, default: points expire 24 months from earn date…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W570_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W570_Task9" name="Quarterly liability review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Quarterly liability review: Finance Manager reviews loyalty points deferred revenue balance — estimate total outstanding points × redemption value (PHP 1.00 per point, per profile §9.2) = deferred revenue liability; compare to prior quarter trend
Responsible (R): Finance Manager
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 2 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W570_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W570_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W570_Task10" name="Annual expiry cycle preparation (T-60 days)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Annual expiry cycle preparation (T-60 days): Loyalty Program Manager configures expiry parameters in loyalty engine per W313 — earn dates qualifying for expiry, minimum points threshold, excluded member tiers (Platinum members may have extended validity)
Responsible (R): Loyalty Program Manager
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W570_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W570_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W570_Task11" name="Pre-expiry member notification (T-30 days)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Pre-expiry member notification (T-30 days): system generates &quot;Your points are expiring!&quot; notifications to affected members via: (a) Push notification via BuildRight app; (b) Email with points balance and suggested redemption options; (c) SMS for members without app/email
Responsible (R): System / Digital Marketing Specialist
Accountable (A): Loyalty Program Manager
Duration: Automated + 2 hours review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W570_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W570_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W570_Task12" name="Recovery campaign activation (T-30 to T-0)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Recovery campaign activation (T-30 to T-0): Digital Marketing launches &quot;Use it or lose it!&quot; campaign — targeted offers to encourage redemption before expiry (e.g., bonus redemption value for select items, free shipping on points-redemption orders)
Responsible (R): Digital Marketing Specialist
Accountable (A): Loyalty Program Manager
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W570_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W570_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W570_Task13" name="Member service preparation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Member service preparation: Customer Service team briefed on expiry timeline and trained on common inquiry responses (&quot;Can I extend my points?&quot;, &quot;Why did my points expire?&quot;); FAQ updated on website and app
Responsible (R): Customer Service Lead
Accountable (A): Loyalty Program Manager
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W570_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W570_Flow29</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W570_Task14" name="Expiry batch processing (T-0)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Expiry batch processing (T-0): loyalty engine executes batch — points with earn date older than 24 months (and no qualifying transaction in that period) are set to zero; transaction log records per-member expiry detail for audit trail
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Loyalty Program Manager
Duration: Automated (batch run: ~2–4 hours processing)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W570_Flow29</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W570_Flow30</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W570_Task15" name="Financial posting">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Financial posting: system posts journal entry — DR Loyalty Deferred Revenue / CR Loyalty Points Expired (non-revenue income) per PFRS 15 interpretation
Responsible (R): System / Finance Manager
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Automated + 1 hour review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W570_Flow30</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W570_Flow31</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W570_Task16" name="Post-expiry notification (T+1)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Post-expiry notification (T+1): affected members receive confirmation of points expiry with remaining balance and encouragement to continue earning
Responsible (R): System / Digital Marketing Specialist
Accountable (A): Loyalty Program Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W570_Flow31</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W570_Flow32</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W570_Task17" name="Re-enrollment incentive (T+7)">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: Re-enrollment incentive (T+7): expired members with zero balance receive re-engagement offer (sign-up bonus of 500 points with qualifying purchase within 30 days)
Responsible (R): System / Digital Marketing Specialist
Accountable (A): Loyalty Program Manager
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W570_Flow32</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W570_Flow33</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W570_Task18" name="Post-expiry reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 10: Post-expiry reconciliation: CRM Analyst reconciles total expired points against financial posting; investigate discrepancies between system records and GL entries
Responsible (R): CRM Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W570_Flow33</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W570_Flow34</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W570_Task19" name="Quarterly deferred revenue adjustment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 11: Quarterly deferred revenue adjustment: Finance Manager adjusts deferred revenue balance for: new points earned, points redeemed per W550, points expired, and breakage estimate (points that will never be redeemed)
Responsible (R): Finance Manager
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 2 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W570_Flow34</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W570_Flow35</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W570_Task20" name="Annual loyalty liability report">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 12: Annual loyalty liability report: comprehensive report for external auditors per W351 — points liability methodology, expiry policy, breakage rate, deferred revenue balance, and PFRS 15 compliance notes
Responsible (R): Loyalty Program Manager / Finance Manager
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 8 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W570_Flow35</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W570_Flow36</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W570_End21" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W570_Flow36</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W570_Annotation22">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-281 (ensure controlled execution — Campaign Planning &amp; Execution (PA-14.1).) | - operational: 30-day advance notification; operational: enrollment materials that explicitly state expiry terms; operational: quarterly review and Finance Manager oversight
Owner: Loyalty Program Manager / Finance Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W570_Assoc23" sourceRef="W570_Annotation22" targetRef="W570_Start8" associationDirection="None" />
